---
source: crates/rustman-cli/src/tests.rs
expression: help
---
List the stored results of a monitor, newest first

Usage: rustman monitor history [OPTIONS] <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          The monitor (its name)

Options:
      --since <DURATION>
          Only results this recent: 30m, 24h, 7d

      --outcome <OUTCOME>
          Only results with this outcome: pass, fail, error or skipped

      --json
          Print JSON lines instead of a table

      --workspace <DIR>
          Workspace directory (default: search from the current directory upwards)

      --color <WHEN>
          Color: auto (a terminal without NO_COLOR or TERM=dumb), always or never
          
          [default: auto]

  -v, --verbose...
          Log more on stderr: -v requests, -vv headers, -vvv everything (RUST_LOG, when set, replaces these levels)

  -h, --help
          Print help
